"><p style=3D"margin:0"><span>&nbsp;iLoveKare, established in 2013 by Kimbe=
rly Haase, is a compassionate team committed to enhancing the lives of thos=
e we serve. Our highly trained and empathetic caregivers offer personalized=
 home care tailored to each client=E2=80=99s unique needs and schedules, em=
powering them to savor life on their own terms. With 23 years of experience=
 working with aging adults, Kimberly brings a wealth of knowledge and dedic=
ation to her role. She actively contributes to various organizations.</span=
></p><p style=3D"margin:0"><span>She served on the Atlanta Regional Commiss=
ion Advisory Committee on Aging (ARC), the Cherokee County Volunteer Aging =
Council (VAC) and Senior Citizens Council of Cobb County. She is a member o=
f the National Concierge Association (NCA) &nbsp;Business Professional Wome=
n of Canton-Cherokee, Kennesaw Business association(KBA), &nbsp;Advocate fo=
r Community Oncology (CPAN) and &nbsp;sits on Acworth Cultural arts' board =
along with serving numerous committees.</span></p></div></div></div></div><=
